{
  "summary": "This experiment tested scgpt as the RNA encoder with transformer aggregation in a multiprofile RNA-only setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5136 (F1: 0.4982). The result suggests scgpt may underperform compared to scvi_n200 in similar configurations, but the exact impact of encoder choice remains uncertain due to limited direct comparison. The role of transformer aggregation versus other methods in this setup requires further validation."
}

